      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What if countries stopped racing for GDP growth? What if companies competed to solve real problems instead of dominate markets? What if success was measured by health, happiness, and well-being, not just profit?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This isn’t fantasy. The technology and tools already exist. What’s missing is the choice to use them for collective good instead of narrow gain.",
