          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Right now, outdated systems, driven by profit, rivalry, and mistrust, are holding us back. But a better world is possible if we shift from competition to cooperation.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Why the Problem Isn’t Scarcity, It’s Coordination",
