      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When well-being becomes the goal, cooperation becomes the strategy.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Global Problems Need Global Collaboration",
