      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These models work, when we choose to cooperate instead of compete.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Culture Shift: Redefining Success",
            "marks": [
              "bold"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Competition isn’t just in our economies, it’s baked into our culture.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "From school rankings to corporate ladders, we’re taught to win by beating others, not by lifting everyone. But it doesn’t have to be that way.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": 1,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "🏫 ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Finland:",
                  "marks": [
                    "bold"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Avoids standardized testing until late in school and still ranks among the best in education.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "🤝 ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Worker Cooperatives:",
                  "marks": [
                    "bold"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Organizations like Mondragon in Spain thrive through shared ownership.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "🏨 ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Community Land Trusts:",
                  "marks": [
                    "bold"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " Provide stable, affordable housing by removing profit motives.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "People don’t need to compete to be motivated. When their needs are met and contributions are valued, they collaborate more, not less.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Real Choice Ahead",
            "marks": [
              "bold"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We have the technology to solve hunger, homelessness, and the climate crisis. But we’re stuck in systems built for rivalry.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "It’s time to ask: Do we want a future of hoarding and competition? Or one of shared progress and cooperation?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The tools are ready. The question is: are we?",
