              "bold"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Would you rather live in a world built on collaboration, or stuck in competition? Drop your thoughts in the comments. Let’s imagine what comes next, together.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      }
